{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skin of Hillding -\u00a0Hraedblood Runexox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743880/extras/\u5934\u56feen.jpg?t=1748311235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the skin of Hillding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A warrior of the northern ice, whose aspect has been befouled into that of a draugr doomed to eternal blood-hunger, as the fruit of a blighting sorcery that has claimed half his soul. Where his great axe swings, flesh and bone are ground to dust; with flesh singed by sigil-brands, his sanity ever looms on the brink of collapse. He shambles the battlefield's edge, shackled between slaughter and unrelenting curse. Only by strangulating the hex at its source can his interminable torment be brought to end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743880?t=1748311235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743880?t=1748311235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743880/bd23da93a9e882682b42469474b9ad8b633e64f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748311235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743880/bd23da93a9e882682b42469474b9ad8b633e64f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748311235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skin of Hillding -\u00a0Hraedblood Runexox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a